# Product voice

**Per-product overrides:** edit [docs/PRODUCT-VOICE.md](../../docs/PRODUCT-VOICE.md) for your Carrier product mock. This file is the shared Carrier cloud reference (VRF-origin patterns).

**Region is never a user-facing word.** Internal keys (`region`, `formatRegion`) may stay.

## Places

| Concept | Name | Where |
|---|---|---|
| Seat territory | Managed Scope | Carrier seat column, filter, Add/Edit scope columns |
| Site where | Location | Compact `Admin1, Country` on lists and site filters |
| How to find it | Address | Full street on forms and drawers |

## People and companies

- Account = login (email). Seat = permission slot.
- Column and form **Name**. **End-User** (hyphen, capital U).
- User-facing noun **company**. No org or customer group on screen.

## Buttons, errors, empty

- Fields, helpers, errors, empty states: sentence case. Nav and toolbar: Title Case.
- Optional labels: `(optional)`.
- Destructive stay: Keep {noun}, never Cancel opposite Delete.
- Toasts: past result, no successfully, no please.
- Empty: **No {noun} yet** when unconstrained; **No {noun} match these filters** after search or filters.

## Table tags

Closed-set status cells use `DS.tag` (color + text). Do not chip names, emails, SNs, dates, Location, or Address.

- **Equipment Brand** for manufacturer (never Device Brand).
- Connectivity / status enums: define in `docs/PRODUCT-VOICE.md` for your product.
